ENCOURAGEMENT
OF FRENCH ARTISTS BY THEIR GOVERNMENT
ACQUAPENDENTEPOOR BEGGAR, THE ORIGINAL OF
A SKETCH BY COLEBOLSENAVOLSCINIUM
