At Parma we ate parmesan and saw
the
Correggio.
The angel who holds the book up to the infant
Savior
,
the female laying her cheek to his feet, the
countenance of the holy child himself, are creations
that seem apart from all else in the schools of
painting
.
They are like a group, not from life, but from
