without even decomposing his gaze. It was
suggested
to the sufferer presently that he was decapitated, but
he thought not. Upon which one of his friends
stepped
up, and
begging he would take the pains to stir
himself a little
, his head fell to the ground. If the
story be not true the moral is. In the many times I
