It was a muggy, misty, London twilight. I was
coming up to town from Blackheath, and in the
crowded vehicle had chanced to encounter my
compatriot
B (call it Brown), who had been
lionizing
the Thames tunnel. In the course of
conversation
,
it came out that we were both on the town for
