Don't marry her, Tom!
Six weeks after this conversation, I was at the
wedding
and reader will please pass to the rear the
six succeeding monthsshort time as it seemsto
record a change in the bland sky of matrimony. It was
an ellipse in our friendship as well; for advice (
contrary
to our wishes and intentions) is apt to be
resented
