kneaded into balls. In Nipal the leathern attire is
dispensed with, and the resin is gathered on the skins
of naked natives.
The plant from which this extraordinary drug is
extracted
,
is
Indian hemp;
differing from the hemp of
this and other northern countries only by the presence
of this narcotic stimulant. There are several
preparations
