could scarce have a better advertisement for
attraction
than a paragraph which announces that she has
been robbed of six hundred dollars worth of jewelry,
and that MANY
heavy articles of plate, rich dresses,
&c., were
LEFT UNDISTURBED! I am inclined to
think that this is a covert puff from Mitchell's
genius
for
he
is
a genius, and quite capable of knowing
