have to throw out will be slighted by the
good-looking
;
taken advantage of by the plainthus levelling,
in another respect,
upward
.
The rarest thing seen in Broadway is a young man
who
walks
well. A stoop in the back is almost
national
;
and an upright, graceful, gentlemanlike gait
