obituary, were I to read it in a newspaper of
to-morrow
,
would speak scarce quicker to my heart than to
those scissors of undiscriminating circum-cision!
With the knowledge that the sky above me was
enriched
,
as Florence once was, by the return of its
long-lost and best model of beauty, I should ask,
with be-paragraphed griefwill her death do for
the Mirror?
But you are alive to laugh at mealive to be (is
